chung.Description:
The course is designed to enable students to:

- Instruct, develop and deliver presentations and speeches in different levels and styles;

- Build up students confidence and performance as a dynamic speaker;

- Develop voices, movements and gestures to engage audiences while speaking;

- Prepare, develop and deliver effective speeches for a range of purposes, occasions, and audiences;

- Make use of speechwriting techniques with storytelling, argument, style, topic framing, and discussing evidence.
